- Recommended next action: from the same WSL/Linux terminal that contains this repository, run `./.venv/bin/python google_workspace_admin.py inspect-gmail-routing` and complete the fresh OAuth consent flow in the browser. Do not paste the callback URL or authorization code into chat.
